steps.instruction:
Edit 04-blast-search.pl (and similarly 01-bio-searchio.pl) to set the e‑value threshold and extend the output line:
Replace the line defining the minimum e‑value with:
    my $min = 1e-10;
Replace the print statement with:
    say join "\t", $result->query_name, $hit->name, $hit->description, $hsp->percent_identity, $hsp->length('total'), $hsp->evalue;
